    "No source file of Minikin, HarfBuzz, ICU or the AOSP headers is modified.",
    "lab/minikin-wrapper.cpp: the MinikinFont of the virtual device (in the place of hwui MinikinFontSkia): FreeType linear advances, 26.6 control boxes and Skia font extents computed from the font tables with HarfBuzz; FreeType hinting is not modelled",
